       <property name="html">
        <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;7. Método de Jacobi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;7.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de Jacobi es un algoritmo numérico iterativo utilizado para resolver sistemas de ecuaciones lineales cuadrados (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ecuaciones con &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; incógnitas) de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(32)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Es especialmente útil en sistemas de gran dimensión y matrices dispersas (con muchos ceros), donde los métodos directos como Gauss o la matriz inversa resultan computacionalmente muy costosos en memoria y tiempo de ejecución.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;7.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método consiste en despejar cada incógnita &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de la &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;-ésima ecuación del sistema (asumiendo que los elementos de la diagonal principal son no nulos, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ≠ 0) y generar una sucesión de vectores &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(0)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, ..., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; a partir de una aproximación inicial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(0)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;. En cada iteración &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, todas las variables se actualizan de manera simultánea utilizando exclusivamente los valores de la iteración anterior &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Para garantizar la convergencia del método sin importar el vector inicial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(0)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, una condición suficiente es que la matriz &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; sea estrictamente diagonalmente dominante:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
