&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:x-large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;8. Método de Gauss-Seidel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;8.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de Gauss-Seidel es un algoritmo numérico iterativo utilizado para resolver sistemas de ecuaciones lineales cuadrados (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ecuaciones con &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; incógnitas) de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(37)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Constituye una mejora directa respecto al método de Jacobi, ya que acelera significativamente la velocidad de convergencia y reduce a la mitad los requerimientos de almacenamiento al actualizar las incógnitas de manera secuencial dentro de una misma iteración.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;8.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Al igual que en Jacobi, se despeja cada variable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de la &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;-ésima ecuación suponiendo &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ≠ 0, partiendo de un vector inicial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(0)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;. La diferencia fundamental radica en que, al calcular &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;+1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; se utilizan inmediatamente los valores recién obtenidos &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;+1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, ..., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;−1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;+1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de la iteración actual, combinados con los valores aún no actualizados &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, ..., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de la iteración anterior.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;La convergencia está garantizada para cualquier vector inicial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;(0)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; si la matriz &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es estrictamente diagonalmente dominante o si &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; es simétrica y definida positiva:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
